Here is the commit message:
OOZIE-2377 Hive2 Action should not propagate oozie.hive2.*
 properties to Beeline (rkanter)

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the Oozie framework improperly propagating all Oozie configuration properties, including `oozie.hive2.*`, to Beeline during the execution of Hive2 actions. This led to unintended configurations being passed through, which could affect the behavior and execution of Beeline commands.

